      "id": "claim_ff3460958fa24fa4b7e0f5e732bec08a",
      "statement": "The persistent scoped worker pool (`zstd_pool::par_for_index`) provides thread-local Zstd context pooling (one compressor per level + one decompressor per thread) and global context reuse (up to 32 compressors per level, 32 decompressors), with the calling thread always participating inline to avoid thundering-herd wakeups on small workloads.",
